292
00:10:39,718 --> 00:10:42,347
Later came Mary Kay Cosmetics,

293
00:10:42,347 --> 00:10:45,151
founded in nineteen sixty-three,

294
00:10:45,151 --> 00:10:48,657
whose top saleswomen won pink Cadillacs.

295
00:10:48,837 --> 00:10:52,512
Pampered Chef, Longaberger baskets and dozens of

296
00:10:52,512 --> 00:10:53,737
others followed.

297
00:10:53,917 --> 00:10:56,668
The salesman stopped knocking on the door.

298
00:10:56,848 --> 00:10:59,368
Instead, your friend invited you in.

299
00:10:59,718 --> 00:11:02,423
So what happened to the door-to-door salesman?

300
00:11:02,603 --> 00:11:05,029
The first reason was that nobody was

301
00:11:05,029 --> 00:11:05,366
home.

302
00:11:05,546 --> 00:11:06,825
In nineteen fifty,

303
00:11:06,825 --> 00:11:09,811
most married women didn't work outside the

304
00:11:09,811 --> 00:11:10,167
home.

305
00:11:10,347 --> 00:11:11,742
By nineteen eighty,

306
00:11:11,742 --> 00:11:12,843
about half did.

307
00:11:13,023 --> 00:11:15,119
When the salesman rang the bell at

308
00:11:15,119 --> 00:11:16,413
two in the afternoon,

309
00:11:16,413 --> 00:11:17,400
nobody answered.

310
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:20,262
The whole business depended on someone being

311
00:11:20,262 --> 00:11:21,481
home during the day.

312
00:11:21,831 --> 00:11:23,920
The second reason was the store.

313
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:28,435
Supermarkets, discount stores and malls offered everything

314
00:11:28,435 --> 00:11:29,780
the salesmen sold,

315
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:32,619
often cheaper, with no pressure and no

316
00:11:32,619 --> 00:11:33,516
appointment.

317
00:11:33,696 --> 00:11:35,708
Why wait for the Fuller Brush man

318
00:11:35,708 --> 00:11:37,475
