319
00:11:37,475 --> 00:11:37,841
Kmart?

320
00:11:38,021 --> 00:11:39,820
The third reason was fear.

321
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,712
As neighborhoods changed,

322
00:11:41,712 --> 00:11:44,725
people became more nervous about opening the

323
00:11:44,725 --> 00:11:46,026
door to a stranger.

324
00:11:46,376 --> 00:11:50,144
Towns passed laws requiring permits for door-to-door

325
