sales.

326
00:11:50,758 --> 00:11:53,719
Homeowners put up No Soliciting signs.

327
00:11:53,899 --> 00:11:55,704
In the nineteen seventies,

328
00:11:55,704 --> 00:11:58,827
the government introduced a cooling-off rule,

329
00:11:58,827 --> 00:12:01,673
which gave customers three days to cancel

330
00:12:01,673 --> 00:12:03,477
a sale made at their home.

331
00:12:03,657 --> 00:12:06,074
Then came television shopping,

332
00:12:06,074 --> 00:12:07,846
catalogs, and finally,

333
00:12:07,846 --> 00:12:08,893
the internet.

334
00:12:09,244 --> 00:12:11,992
The Fuller Brush Company still exists,

335
00:12:11,992 --> 00:12:14,741
but it sells mostly online and through

336
00:12:14,741 --> 00:12:15,536
stores now.

337
00:12:15,716 --> 00:12:17,977
Avon still has representatives,

338
00:12:17,977 --> 00:12:20,894
but most of their business moved online,

339
00:12:20,894 --> 00:12:22,717
and through social media.

340
00:12:22,897 --> 00:12:27,129
Encyclopedia Britannica printed its last edition in

341
00:12:27,129 --> 00:12:28,539
two thousand ten.

342
00:12:28,719 --> 00:12:31,330
And the milkman disappeared from most of

343
00:12:31,330 --> 00:12:33,549
America by the nineteen seventies.

344
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,095
What did we lose?

345
00:12:35,275 --> 00:12:36,599
Not just the products.

346
00:12:36,779 --> 00:12:39,113
We lost a kind of human contact.

347
00:12:39,293 --> 00:12:41,585
The Fuller Brush man knew your name,

348
00:12:41,585 --> 00:12:43,495
and asked about your children.

349
00:12:43,675 --> 00:12:45,487
The Avon lady was your neighbor.

350
00:12:45,667 --> 00:12:47,478
The milkman knew if you were sick.

351
00:12:47,658 --> 00:12:49,419
For many lonely housewives,

352
00:12:49,419 --> 00:12:51,638
those visits were a bright spot in

353
00:12:51,638 --> 00:12:52,813
a long, quiet day.

354
00:12:53,163 --> 00:12:55,904
Today, the packages still come to the

355
00:12:55,904 --> 00:12:56,274
door.

356
00:12:56,454 --> 00:12:58,681
But now, they're left on the step

357
00:12:58,681 --> 00:13:00,773
