358
00:13:00,953 --> 00:13:02,332
The doorbell rings,

359
00:13:02,332 --> 00:13:04,363
and by the time you open the

360
00:13:04,363 --> 00:13:05,887
door, nobody's there.

361
00:13:06,067 --> 00:13:06,677
In a way,

362
00:13:06,677 --> 00:13:09,724
the door-to-door salesman was the last person

363
00:13:09,724 --> 00:13:11,756
who came to your house just to

364
00:13:11,756 --> 00:13:12,569
talk to you.

365
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:14,753
So tell us in the comments.

366
00:13:14,933 --> 00:13:16,220
Who came to your door when you

367
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:16,907
were growing up?

368
00:13:17,087 --> 00:13:19,276
Did your mother buy from the Fuller

369
00:13:19,276 --> 00:13:20,964
Brush man or the Avon lady?

370
00:13:21,144 --> 00:13:22,995
Did you ever sell anything door to

371
00:13:22,995 --> 00:13:23,757
